{"t":"say","text":"Router pattern: Chat App Message Service ingress, guard, classify, order lookup or draft reply, with human escalation."}
{"t":"assume","id":"order-api","text":"Customer exposes an order query API callable via adapter"}
{"t":"assume","id":"chatapp-config","text":"WhatsApp and LINE channels are configured in Chat App service"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many chat messages per day do you expect across WhatsApp and LINE?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline for first-contact resolution?"}
{"t":"step","id":"inbound","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive WhatsApp/LINE message","product":"chatapp","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for both chat channels via Chat App Message Service"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen inbound message","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection and harmful content before any processing"}
{"t":"step","id":"classify","kind":"ai","label":"Classify user intent","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Route order questions to lookup, others to fallback or handoff"}
{"t":"step","id":"order-lookup","kind":"tool","label":"Query order system","effect":"read","runs":"customer","private":true,"why":"Fetch order details from the customer's own order management system"}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-reply","kind":"ai","label":"Draft order answer","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Compose a grounded natural-language reply using order data"}
{"t":"step","id":"output-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen outbound reply","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Prevent private data leaks and harmful content in the reply"}
{"t":"step","id":"send-reply","kind":"act","label":"Send chat reply","effect":"reply","product":"chatapp","runs":"fc","why":"Deliver the guarded answer back through Chat App Message Service"}
{"t":"step","id":"handoff","kind":"human","label":"Human agent takes over","task":"takeover","runs":"customer","why":"Escalate when AI cannot resolve or confidence is low"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-resolved","kind":"end","label":"Conversation resolved","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-handoff","kind":"end","label":"Handed off to agent","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"inbound-guard","from":"inbound","to":"guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-classify","from":"guard","to":"classify"}
{"t":"link","id":"classify-order","from":"classify","to":"order-lookup","kind":"branch","label":"Order inquiry detected"}
{"t":"link","id":"classify-handoff","from":"classify","to":"handoff","kind":"escalate","label":"Uncertain or non-order request"}
{"t":"link","id":"order-draft","from":"order-lookup","to":"draft-reply"}
{"t":"link","id":"draft-output","from":"draft-reply","to":"output-guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"output-send","from":"output-guard","to":"send-reply"}
{"t":"link","id":"output-handoff","from":"output-guard","to":"handoff","kind":"escalate","label":"Unsafe or unanswerable content"}
{"t":"link","id":"send-end","from":"send-reply","to":"end-resolved"}
{"t":"link","id":"handoff-end","from":"handoff","to":"end-handoff"}
{"t":"done","summary":"WhatsApp and LINE chatbot using Chat App Message Service with input/output guards, order lookup, AI drafting and human takeover escalation."}
